OL,3,AAmy Dowden praised for 'iconic'
OL,4,Aclapback at ex-Strictly professional
OL,5,Adancer
OL,6,
OL,7,FStrictly star Amy Dowden has been
OL,8,Fpraised for her "iconic" clapback after
OL,9,Fex-Strictly dancer Brendan Cole claimed
OL,10,Fshe was "not up to" the challenge of
OL,11,Fthe show.
OL,13,FDowden, who has previously spoken
OL,14,Fopenly about being treated for breast
OL,15,Fcancer, was the first professional to
OL,16,Fbe eliminated in the 2026 series, with
OL,17,Fher celebrity partner Chris Appleton.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
