OL,3,AAmy Dowden praised for 'iconic'
OL,4,Aclapback at ex-Strictly professional
OL,5,Adancer
OL,6,
OL,7,F"To be a pro on Strictly is a big job
OL,8,Fand one has to be up to the challenge,"
OL,9,FCole reportedly told Sky Vegas, adding:
OL,10,F"Amy has not been up to the challenge,
OL,11,Fin my opinion."
OL,13,FRather than a direct response, Dowden
OL,14,Fposted a video on her social media
OL,15,Fwhich has been praised as a "perfect"
OL,16,Freaction by viewers and some of her
OL,17,Ffellow Strictly professionals.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
